# Datasets listed here are skipped by order_graphs / vary / evaluate / compare-seeds
# discovery (same idea as .gitignore, paths relative to data/).
#
#   example       skip dataset key "example" (and any */example)
#   ignore/       skip everything under data/ignore/
#   amazon/music  skip one nested key
#   raw/          already skipped by default; safe to repeat

example
amazon/software
amazon/movies
